# Files whose exact bytes ARE the artifact. Git's end-of-line translation is
# on by default on Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf), which rewrites every LF
# to CRLF in anything it decides is text — and both of these are JSON, so it
# decides they are text.
#
# For the signature vectors that is fatal and was not theoretical: the signed
# manifest is 2012 bytes with 62 newlines, a Windows checkout handed the test
# 2074 different bytes, and verification failed with SignatureMismatch on the
# Windows job while Ubuntu stayed green. A signature covers bytes, so a file
# under a signature must never be translated.
#
# The Windows evidence captures are here for the same reason rather than a
# current failure: the file exists to record exactly what a Windows host
# emitted, and a checkout that rewrites it has destroyed the thing it was
# collected to prove. Today's replay only reads their base64 payloads, so
# translation would pass unnoticed — which is the argument for pinning it now
# and not after a future test starts checking the file itself.
src-tauri/broker-core/vectors/*.json -text
evidence/windows/*.json            -text

# Tauri's build script regenerates these permission files on every build, and
# on Windows it writes CRLF. Committed with LF, they then show as modified in
# every Windows working tree the moment anyone compiles — a diff with no
# content change, which trains people to ignore a dirty tree. Pin LF so the
# generated bytes and the committed bytes agree on both platforms.
src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/*.toml text eol=lf

# Vendored design tokens and Opal source files are verified by exact SHA256
# digests against PROVENANCE.md. On Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf, Git
# silently translates LF to CRLF in text files, mutating the bytes and failing
# the security-contract tests. Pin LF so the checked-out bytes match the digests.
src/design/tokens/*.json           text eol=lf
src/design/opal/**                 text eol=lf
src/design/fonts/**                -text
src/design/shared/**               text eol=lf
src/design/tailwind-preset.cjs     text eol=lf
